!Name: ship-c12d-p6144line
!C A diagonal c/12 period 6144 spaceship which contains a diagonal line
!C which grows and shrinks.  This is shown at its minimal population of 4620.
!C Shifting the back Cordership forwards or backwards in its path by multiples
!C of 88 cells changes the period by multiples of 1154 generations.
!C David I. Bell, July 2005
!Source: jslife-moving
